* Butterfly Valve Assembly *
This project demonstrates the design and development of a Butterfly Valve Assembly using SolidWorks. 
The model consists of five major components: Housing, Shaft, Valve Disc, Valve Cover, and Operating Arm, integrated into a complete mechanical assembly.

The design represents the structural arrangement of a butterfly valve, focusing on component positioning, assembly relationships, and dimensional accuracy. 
Individual parts were modeled and assembled to understand the construction and operating mechanism of the valve.
The project is supported by detailed engineering documentation, including 2D component drawings and assembly drafting with orthographic projections, sectional views, isometric representation, and dimensional annotations.


Technical Overview
CAD Platform: SolidWorks
Assembly: Butterfly Valve
Components: 5 individual parts
Design Skills: 3D Part Modeling, Assembly Design, Component Integration, Sectional Drafting, and Engineering Documentation
